Kotlin/Mini standard library sources (std/kotlin-mini)

This directory contains source code ported or derived from the Kotlin standard library
(https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin, libraries/stdlib, core/builtins), which is

    Copyright 2010-2025 JetBrains s.r.o. and Kotlin Programming Language contributors.
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

Derived files carry the original copyright notice in their header and name the original file they
were ported from. Changes against the originals: expect/actual and JVM/JS/Native specifics removed,
contracts and Serializable removed, collections reimplemented on a native reference array
(mini.internal.refArray*), `throw` sites routed through mini.internal.throw*, String functions
reimplemented on top of String.get/length (no regex, ASCII/Latin-1 character classification).

Files without such a header (std/kotlin-mini/mini/**, java/lang/Thread.kt, mini/internal/*) are part of
Kotlin/Mini itself.

